[@1]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Time to make yourself useful.
<$Config,atobjective1=0>
<$Config,atobjective2=0>
<$Config,atobjective3=0>
<$Config,atobjective4=0>
<$Config,atobjective5=0>
<$Config,atobjective6=0>
<$Config,atobjective7=0>
<$Config,atobjective8=0>
<$Config,atweapon0=0>
$Timeout=3,DoNothing,0

[@2]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Although I can easily take out these fools, this will be good practice for you.
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@60]
<h2>~gGeneral Zolt</h2>
<p>Prepare yourself for the great beyond Kalrek!
$Timeout=4,DoNothing,0

[@61]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>HA!  You first!
$Timeout=2,DoNothing,0

[@62]
<h2>~mLord Negan</h2>
<p>Once I defeat you I shall have the title of Sun Master!  Which you have wrongfully kept from me!
$Timeout=7,DoNothing,0

[@63]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>You will learn the hard way of how I got my title!  Prepare to die!
$Timeout=6,DoNothing,0

[@120]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Come now Negan give this up, you cannot hope to defeat me.
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@121]
<h2>~mLord Negan</h2>
<p>No!  I shall not leave here until I am the Sun Master! 
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0 

[@122]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>You may have been my student, but you were never a great one.
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@123]
<h2>~mLord Negan</h2>
<p>Liar! I was the best!
$Timeout=3,DoNothing,0

[@124]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>A great student is one that has learned how to surpass his master.  You my friend, have yet to do that.
$Timeout=8,DoNothing,0

[@125]
<h2>~mLord Negan</h2>
<p>I will show you!  And I'll do it by killing you!!
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@126]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>We shall see.
$Timeout=3,DoNothing,0


[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Old Ties</h2>
<i>"Don't confuse yourself as being the best."<br>
-- Kalrek</i>  
<p>Kalreks formor pupil Lord Negan has ambushed him while he was teaching you.  Caught off guard Negan's General was able to manuver close in and launched an attack.
<p>You must help your mentor defeat these two or perish.

<?!{atweapon0}>$Button=Prepare,Tell,OldTech</?>
<?{atweapon0}>$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55</?>
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=Finished,Tell,objective1

